            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Asteroid Squadron 1.34</h2>
<ul>
<li>Added Sparkle software updates. Choose <strong>Asteroid Squadron → Check for Updates…</strong> to check manually, or enable <strong>Check for Updates Automatically</strong>.</li>
<li>Updates and the GitHub-hosted update feed use Ed25519 signatures, alongside Developer ID signing and Apple notarization.</li>
<li>Update installation waits until an active recording is saved or discarded.</li>
</ul>
<p>Install this version once from the DMG or ZIP to enable future in-app updates. Requires an Apple Silicon Mac running macOS 13 or newer.</p>
]]></description>
